<title>POLAND: ELPO JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELPO JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.23 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.36 vs   0.43</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.09 vs   0.46</p>
<p> Sales		    1.51 vs   1.14</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.08 vs   0.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.50 vs   0.83</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.44 vs   0.96</p>
<p> Sales		    1.73 vs   6.94</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Przemyslu Odziezowego SA Elpo .</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
